  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "First prize may be given to any one of the 4 boys, hence first prize can be distributed in 4 ways. similarly every one of second, third, fourth and fifth prizes can also be given in 4 ways. the number of ways of their distribution $=4 \\times 4 \\times 4 \\times 4 \\times 4=4^{5}=1024$",
    "image": null
  },
